# Kiril's Level 3: Rising Water Escape
# The platform stack is mapped directly from Kiril's multi-level water-escape
# sketch: pipe and player on the bottom floor; a lower-right ladder; the broad
# boulder lane; then increasingly staggered platforms to the top-left exit.
script water_escape
bounds 0 0 1600 900
playerStart 520 810

# A pipe on the bottom-left floor continually fills the connected chamber.
water 32 28 1536 822 6 0.04 1
valveFluidFill 0 0.96 22

# Chamber shell and bottom floor. The player begins beside the pipe outlet,
# rather than on a platform above it.
solid 0 0 1600 28
solid 0 28 32 872
solid 1568 28 32 872
solid 32 850 1536 50

# Lowest elevated lane and the corrected lower-right ladder. This is the first
# climb from the pipe floor in the original design.
platform 32 740 1438 30
ladder 1415 740 48 110

# Broad boulder/enemy lane.
platform 130 627 1438 30
enemy 455 587 34 40 325 625 68
boulder 865 592 30 3.4
enemy 1170 587 34 40 1080 1335 70

# The first ceiling door hangs in the tall gap between this lane and the next
# platform. Its 84px plank has clear space to swing down without touching floor.
button 1250 611 76 16
trapDoor 1390 502 84 8 0 minimal
buttonTrapDoor 0 0 76 150

# Central acid lane and left-side climb.
platform 32 472 187 30
platform 270 472 1200 30
ladder 430 472 48 155
enemy 630 432 34 40 545 745 65

# The second short door is attached under the y=350 ceiling platform. Its 70px
# plank clears the y=472 floor when it swings down.
button 1250 456 76 16
trapDoor 1390 380 70 8 0 minimal
buttonTrapDoor 1 1 76 150

# Upper center shelf pair, reached from the central ladder.
platform 140 350 700 30
platform 935 350 633 30
ladder 440 259 48 91
enemy 1110 310 34 40 1060 1320 66

# The two smaller shelves and the final ladder reproduce the split platforms
# just below the exit route.
platform 460 259 370 30
platform 1035 259 370 30
ladder 650 157 48 102

# Top-left exit floor, its separate raised release-button shelf, and the
# upper-right shelf. Keeping the release shelf detached matches the diagram.
platform 32 157 330 30
platform 500 90 247 30
platform 935 157 365 30
button 580 74 76 16
buttonExit 2
exit 60 28 85 210
